#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:3
#: 4d35fa849ab54c8b852fb28430400078
msgid "设置磁矩（Set Magnetic Moments）"
msgstr "Set Magnetic Moments"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:5
#: e4240d7033c94d4680d50bbb4f8d8248
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:7
#: 24b88db07dc64fa59bdf506167433433
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:9
#: 9ae997a58a3e490c82ef29869c241376
msgid ""
"把输入结构写成统一的 `spin:R:3` 表示。选择磁矩来源（已有磁矩 / 元素映射 / 常"
"数幅值）、输出格式（标量 / 向量）、参考轴方向和生效元素范围。这是一张基础层卡"
"片——不生成多磁序分支，只为后续磁性卡片提供干净、统一的初始磁矩。内部仍同步维"
"护 ASE `initial_magmoms` 兼容别名。"
msgstr ""
"Write a consistent `spin:R:3` representation to each input structure. Choose "
"the moment source—existing values, an element map, or a constant magnitude—"
"the scalar or vector output format, a reference axis, and the elements to "
"which it applies. This foundational card does not branch into multiple "
"magnetic orders; it prepares a clean, uniform starting state for downstream "
"magnetic cards. The internal ASE `initial_magmoms` compatibility alias is "
"kept in sync."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:11
#: 3c059d6618be429d8c65a5c3ac72dccf
msgid ""
"**和 `Magnetic Order` 的区别：** `Magnetic Order` 从一个母相出发生成 "
"FM+AFM+PM 多分支。本卡只标准化磁矩格式，不创建新磁序。如果你的流程里多张磁性"
"卡都在重复配 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）和 `轴`（`axis`），用本卡统一初始化"
"一次可以消除重复。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:13
#: c2258187b7b144ea979e5caf888f09af
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:15
#: 8533031a8208462c9bcef4926232ca9e
msgid ""
"这张卡执行的是确定性映射而不是磁结构求解。对元素为 $e$ 的原子 $i$，标量模式写"
"入"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:17
#: dc94798de234471b99971bfcd58f1592
msgid ""
"\n"
"m_i=M(e),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:21
#: c9dfd60d74cb4491a37f372e3951a7ec
msgid "非共线模式写入"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:23
#: 183ab40b9a5c4f5c8d9d3a765d0217bc
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf m_i=M(e)\\,\n"
"\\frac{\\mathbf a_e}{\\|\\mathbf a_e\\|},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:28
#: 69350c1073004ac6aba820272b6e5ce2
msgid ""
"其中 $M(e)$ 来自元素-磁矩表，$\\mathbf a_e$ 来自元素方向表；没有独立方向时使"
"用全局 参考轴。未列元素按“默认磁矩”处理。数值单位为 $\\mu_B$。它只设置 "
"`initial_magmoms` 初始标签，不会计算交换作用、自动判断磁性元素或保证 DFT 收敛"
"到该磁态。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:32
#: baab53e72e214662b9d88b01d71d9482
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:34
#: d0afd444be0047c487350410949d2756
msgid "场景：多张磁性卡各自配 magmom_map，配错了一处"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: repeated `magmom_map` settings drift out of sync across magnetic "
"cards"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:36
#: 6366ec42171d4af1b4db470712b1b3e8
msgid ""
"你的训练流水线里有 `Magnetic Order` → `Small-Angle Spin Tilt` → `Spin "
"Spiral` 三张磁性卡。每张卡都有一个 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）输入框，你填了"
"三遍 `Fe:2.2,Co:1.7`。两周后改 Co 的磁矩为 1.5，只改了两张卡，第三张忘了——生"
"成的数据里 Co 的磁矩默默用了旧值。训练出来的模型在含 Co 的构型上能量系统性偏"
"高。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:38
#: 3862336458784c368013c5677f3ca3f5
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 磁性流水线里，磁矩幅值的定义应该只在一处。用本卡在最前面做一次"
"统一初始化，后续磁性卡全部选 \"Existing initial magmoms\" 模式，不再各自定义 "
"magmom_map。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Define moment magnitudes once in a magnetic workflow. Put "
"this card first, then select `Existing initial magmoms` in downstream cards "
"instead of redefining the element map repeatedly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:40
#: a5e1bd57e4ee4501be73b320af4c5664
msgid "**输入：** 一个磁性晶体结构，还没写 `spin` 或 `initial_magmoms`"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A magnetic crystal structure without `spin` or `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:42
#: 41cc5d6f72734ce6b60d979a7730fd23
msgid ""
"**目标：** 统一写入向量格式的初始磁矩，Fe 取 2.2 μB，Co 取 1.7 μB，沿 z 轴，"
"后续卡片全部复用"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Initialize vector moments along *z*, using 2.2 μB for Fe and 1.7 "
"μB for Co, then reuse them throughout the downstream workflow."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:44
#: 472e7ae8b3c54e0fb1c6217289853c8d
