#: 0acdaacce8b943028bdb7d735d1b349a
msgid ""
"**输出：** 1 个结构，带 `MagSet(map,vec)` 标签和 `spin:R:3` 数组。原子位置和"
"数量不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** One structure labeled `MagSet(map,vec)` with a `spin:R:3` array. "
"Atomic positions and counts are unchanged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:52
#: 7a54ef9da33b420f8da7fdd18ca9d3d7
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
