"`bool`，默认 `False`。勾选后 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）中提供的向量方向会被"
"保留，而不是统一投到 `轴`（`axis`）。仅向量格式下有意义。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/set-magnetic-moments-card.md:90
